# https://github.com/sbt/zinc/issues/226
# Every class implicitly sees the names of its enclosing packages, so a new
# class in a nested package can shadow one from an outer package without any
# wildcard import being written.
> compile

# add x.y.B, which shadows x.B inside package x.y
